of plantwaterer/liquamen (https://huggingface.co/plantwaterer/liquamen, revision 4278ee2c: garas_core.py,
garas_engine.py, garas_vbll_engine.py, vbll_core.py, oavg_engine.py, lenavg_engine.py, lenavg_bayes_engine.py,
lenavg_bayes_l6k_engine.py, lenavg_bayes_balanced_k5_engine.py). They are used under the Apache License, Version
2.0, whose text is in LICENSE.


